SUMMARY:Spontaneous Hack & Brainstorming Session with OwnTech.org
DESCRIPTION:\nLet’s meet OwnTech.org and have a look at their Open Source Electronics development!\n \nTo try their boards in Real life they came to the ZAM.haus in Erlangen and use the Vhelio.de OS Cargobike build by OSE-Germany.org as a Prototype Platform. Come Friday night 6pm to find out with HealthHackers.de if the OpenSource power system could be put to use in Medical devices like electric Wheelchairs as well!\n\n
URL:https://www.zam.haus/programm/spontaneous-hack-brainstorming-session-with-owntech-org/
CATEGORIES:Mitmachen,Treffen,Workshop
LOCATION:ZAM, Hauptstraße 65-67, 91052 Erlangen
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.zam.haus/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Firefly-Symbolfoto-Gruppe-von-Menschen-Meetup-Comupter-nerds-having-fun-creating-stuff-related-to.jpg
END:VEVENT
